1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Your pull request passes. But what did it do to the next change?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
EvolveCI is an experiment in counterfactual CI.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Run the same maintainer-chosen follow-up on base and head.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,000
In the demo: one changed file on base, four on head.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,000
No opaque maintainability score. Keep the evidence.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Failures stay visible. Inconclusive is a result.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
It tests one chosen follow-up. It does not predict your roadmap.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
It is rough and early. Run the fixture and poke holes in it.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Your pull request passes. Test the change after it.
